WEBVTT

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.440
Remember to take it later.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.480
You have to work?

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.820
Yes. I'll probably be back late, so don't wait up.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.990
If only I could assist you like I did in the past...

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.910
I've been constantly telling you not to worry about that, haven't I?

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:20.740
What's wrong?

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.170
Let's be together, always.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.960
I'm satisfied as long as you're by my side.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.020
"A Sub-contractee"

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.320
Here's the medicine, as promised.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:52.900
That's all?

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.570
Hurry up and finish your new mission if you want more.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.450
If you do, I'll double the amount.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.040
You're pretty obsessed with that girl.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.500
Is she strong?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.880
It's inevitable that you will hurt her,

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.300
but try to be gentle with her.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:16.430
Also, it seems that she has a contractee.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.640
I don't care if you kill him.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.310
I only want that Mototsumitama.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:40.320
When are we going to Okinawa?

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.830
As soon as possible.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:45.580
We'll only cause trouble for Akane-san if they follow us here.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.960
I'll take a look around my home.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:51.090
If they aren't there, I'll grab my money.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.630
What about me?

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.880
Stay here.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.510
Also,

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.130
keep our Okinawa plans a secret from Akane-san.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.510
It'll only give her more unnecessary worries.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.390
Okay.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.960
Ibuki Keita-kun?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.710
A Tribal End?

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.670
Gosh, how rude.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.840
I'm a real Mototsumitama.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.960
I'm Houjou Mikami.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.390
I've accepted a request to abduct the Mototsumitama that's contracted to you.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.090
Kuro?

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.760
Ultimately, I'm only after her.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.640
I don't want to hurt you.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.810
Be a good boy and hand her over.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:51.850
What if I refuse?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.730
I'll leave it to your imagination.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.360
So, what will you do?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:58.990
I...

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.200
I refuse!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.580
Even though I warned you...

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.460
You're—!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.090
Keita-san...

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.690
Kuro-chan, why are you in such a hurry?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.570
Akane-san, I've got a very bad feeling!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.900
Something happened to Keita-san!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.570
It's from Keita-kun.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.030
Hello, Keita—

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.250
Huh? Erm...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.040
Yes, she's right here.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.710
Kuro-chan, she wants to talk to you.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.790
Hello?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.550
Ibuki Keita is in my hands.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.550
Come to the area I specified.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:07.510
Wait. Um... Please, wait!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.890
Keita-san has been kidnapped.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.320
That building?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.650
According to the data from Headquarters,

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:25.280
quite a large number of Tribal Ends have been coming in and out of that building.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.240
The Shishigami clan?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.990
Most likely.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.080
This is Steiner.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.830
We're going to rush in now.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.260
I'll head to Okinawa tomorrow morning.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.590
I see.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.600
Thanks to your efforts in gathering the Master Roots,

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.720
we can finally start the project.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.350
You have my thanks.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.640
No, it's nothing.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.560
I hope that you can hurry up and find my Sub.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.230
Yuki-sama, I'm sorry about that.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:06.660
This is Hiyou. I'm sorry for disturbing.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.120
Enter.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.130
Reishin-sama, it's been a while since we last met.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.710
I'll take my leave, then.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.510
Have you been doing your best, you ape?

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:26.340
Yes.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:32.060
Hiyou-sama, this is about Kogure Riona,
whom I loaned to you for an experiment.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.270
What of it?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.810
It's been nearly a month since she's escaped.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.440
If it's going to take you any longer to find her—

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:44.070
I've already received reports saying that that ape has been found.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.280
She'll probably be captured soon.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.570
Is that so?

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:51.740
Feel free to ask if you need a new Master Root.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.800
Reishin-sama, Kuraki is just an ape, after all.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.470
You'll regret it if you place too much trust in him.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.970
Please be careful.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.680
I'll take it into consideration.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.430
No matter how often you look, the scenery here is fantastic.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:19.100
Everything happened when the Reiseki in the pure land became tainted.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:23.020
I wonder what's going on over there nowadays.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.480
And with Kuro-sama.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.440
I wonder.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.750
Good work.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.210
This is...

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.810
Are all of them Mototsumitama?

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.140
What did they do to make them end up like this?

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.190
Steiner!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.360
What's wrong?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.440
Oh, a fragment of the Reiseki?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:14.160
It was probably used as a catalyst to suck all the Tera out of the Mototsumitama

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.200
in order to mass produce Tribal Ends.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.910
The one who designed the device is worthy of admiration,

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.710
but it is rather disgusting.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.880
Did the Shishigami clan do this?

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.710
They might be harder to handle than we thought.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.810
There's no mistaking it.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.570
You...

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.110
I won't use violence if you cooperate with me.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.950
What are you planning to do with me?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.660
You've caught my interest.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.490
Both you and your Mototsumitama.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.330
She's after me.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.460
That's why.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.880
She won't hurt Keita-kun.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.000
Anyway, we have to hurry.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:17.390
Aren't you with those Shishigami clan guys?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.680
It's pretty sad to have people thinking that I'm in the same clan as them.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.900
I'm from the freedom-loving, individualistic Ginko clan.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:29.900
My involvement with the Shishigami clan doesn't go beyond taking  jobs and getting payment from them.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.530
Isn't that the same?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.280
Why did you form a contract with a Mototsumitama?

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.070
What do you mean?

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:40.240
I mean, aren't you a Sub?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:45.040
By "Sub," do you mean that I'll die if I meet another me?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.330
Right.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.790
The Tera of the dead Subs will be sucked up by the Root.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:55.130
The Root will gain a larger amount of Tera  and become a Master Root.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.180
Based on the Doppeliner system,

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.140
the Root is the focus, while the other two exist

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.980
for the sole purpose of having their Tera sucked away.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.310
I'm a Sub...

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.060
The Tera your body gives off is very faint.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.070
Putting Master Roots aside, it's nowhere near the level of a Root's.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.320
Your Mototsumitama didn't tell you that?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.700
Kuro didn't say anything about that.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:25.080
If that's so, you don't know the end result of a Mototsumitama continuing to fight with its contracted Sub either, right?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.540
What will happen?

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.750
That's...

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.380
Give me a minute.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.010
Sorry, were we too noisy?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:45.100
That's rare. You have a guest?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.270
Well, sort of.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.770
Oh, yeah. I got the medicine.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.520
The reward for this mission is more than usual.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.280
Shingo, after I complete it, I'll be able to enjoy time with you for a while.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.740
Enjoy, huh?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:01.950
I'm...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.950
I'm a Sub.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.050
Punipuni, I'll leave Akane-san to you.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.170
Will you be okay alone?

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.840
I'll definitely get Keita-san out,

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.140
and we'll go to Okinawa together after that!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.180
Okinawa?

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.100
What's wrong?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:33.360
It might get a bit noisy, but don't worry.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.000
Keita-san!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.250
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.880
Is it true that I'm a Sub?!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.260
You knew, didn't you? Answer me!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.720
Most likely...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:09.230
But Keita-san, you're my precious partner even if you are a Sub.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:12.270
As long as we trust each other, that's not important!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.980
Trust each other? What a joke.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.150
It's a taboo to form contracts with Subs.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:21.660
You should know why.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.990
I know.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.910
Because the more Tera one has, the more it benefits your fights.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.290
That is why contracts should be with Master Roots.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:30.910
However...

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.920
Subs will die!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:39.840
The amount of Tera consumed by synchro and Exceed can be too much of a burden for Subs.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:45.550
That will exhaust their body, causing it to age prematurely, and  they will eventually die from it.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.770
Impossible. That's just not...

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.060
It's true.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.110
I'm a living example.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.400
Shingo...

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.110
I'm Mikami's contractee.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:06.120
I'm a human who formed a contract with a Mototsumitama even though I'm a Sub.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:11.120
It's already been ten years since I formed a contract with Mikami, but even so, I'm still in my thirties.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.250
Shingo, why did you get up?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:20.000
I just wanted him to see fools like us,
who formed a contact even though it's a taboo.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.130
Unfortunately, they're nothing like us.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.890
They are not mentally prepared for it, and they don't even trust each other.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.060
I'm sorry, Keita-san.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:35.020
I... I didn't even know about something this important...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.270
Do you think everything can be solved by feigning ignorance?!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:50.290
You probably just treat humans as nothing more than tools used in a fight, right?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.410
H-How could that be?!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.910
I'll break a contract made for that purpose

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.250
by killing you!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.550
Kuro made a mistake, so it's okay for you to scold me.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.430
But it's not so shameful that you need to kill me for it!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.350
Stop acting so conceited!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.490
Mikami looks beautiful when she's fighting, doesn't she?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.210
I formed a contract with her because I wanted to help her.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.130
I wanted to fight together with her.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:44.460
If possible, I wanted to die in battle.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:48.220
However, it's going to take more than this to make Mikami rely on my powers.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:53.520
Why don't you give your partner a hand?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.100
I'm...

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.480
You don't care if she dies?

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.770
Kuro will die?!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.110
Contractees aren't tools used for battles.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:12.080
No matter what happens, no matter what method you use, you must always live on with them!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.620
That's what a contract symbolizes!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:19.120
I formed a contract with Keita-san because I wanted to save him!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.630
If that's so, the boy wouldn't sit and watch silently!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.800
She will die?!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.560
Is that my fate?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.600
Is that why Kuro, too, is...

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.310
Mikami is strong.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.360
That resilience is praiseworthy.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:02.080
What are you trying to do?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.850
This is...

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.600
Megaexe.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.270
They synchro'd?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.440
Even though their feelings weren't aligned just now...

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.770
I've had enough...

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.360
Enough of people dying around me!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.870
Kuro, fight with all your might!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.370
Okay!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.040
Using Exceed at the exact moment they synchro'd?

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.460
They're inexperienced but not to be taken lightly.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.380
They are fit to be our opponents.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.790
Not good.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.590
Her power is boosted this greatly by synchro...

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.510
Mikami.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.760
Aren't you forgetting your own partner?

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:58.930
Shingo... But if we synchro, your body will be—!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.980
Do you think I'm that useless a man?

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:08.020
I believe in you.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.910
You're as reliable as ever, Shingo.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:30.420
It brought me much joy when Shingo was still healthy.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.930
My Exceed,

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.510
Renkoubushin!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.020
Kuro!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.600
Keita-san!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.610
The longer the fight, the heavier the burden on Shingo's body.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.610
Taking Keita-san's body into consideration, I have no choice but to end this with one Megaexe.

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:56.490
I'll finish this in one blow!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:13.300
My Exceed is an ability that strengthens my body by drastically increasing the density of my body structure.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:17.220
Fall before my overwhelming offense and defense!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:24.480
No Mototsumitama can stand up to me once I've synchro'd with Shingo!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.480
Kuro!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.310
That's right, Mikami.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.900
We will always wi—

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.950
Kuro, don't give me a second thought!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:43.200
Use your Exceed!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.210
Exceed is fueled by Keita-san's life...

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.080
I must make sure to make a direct hit with it!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.250
Use it, Kuro!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.130
Not yet... Not yet!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:59.050
Take this attack, which is fully powered-up by Renkoubushin!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.760
This is the end!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.730
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.380
Kuro!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.880
Was that your trump card?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.380
We won, Shingo.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.430
Shingo...

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:53.730
I enjoyed the time I spent with you.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.400
I have no regrets.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:02.370
Please don't hate the two of them for giving us a final chance to fight together.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.200
Farewell, Mikami,

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.750
my beloved Mototsumitama.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.170
Shingo!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.640
Hey, Shingo!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.600
Wake up...

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.140
Shingo, you're lying, right?!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.230
Hey, Shingo!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.890
Shingo, why?

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.270
I don't want this!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:40.400
I hope that I die in the coolest way during my final moment.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:49.290
This isn't cool at all...

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.210
Shingo...

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:12.270
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:30.490
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:30.490
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:41.920
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:41.920
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:54.270
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:54.270
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:54.270 --> 00:21:10.700
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:21:10.700
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:26.510
The contract can't be dissolved until either party dies.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.890
The two of you have just started.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:38.600
"Kuro's Past"

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:38.270
Whether a strong bond can be created or not is up to you,

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.020
Kuro.
